{"seq":9,"slug":"basic-algebra-functions","title":"基础代数与函数","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions","rating":{"composite":3.86,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":2.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础代数与函数-简介\">基础代数与函数 简介</h1><p>本知识库是 13 号「数学与统计」分区的<strong>入门基石</strong>，覆盖中学到大一过渡阶段的代数运算、函数、方程不等式与数列级数。它的定位很明确：<strong>为后续所有数学 hub 提供运算基本功与符号直觉</strong>——当你在线性代数里做矩阵消元、在微积分里展开泰勒级数、在最优化里写损失函数时，所依赖的代数操作与函数观念都在这里打底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>13 号分区里多个 hub 主题相邻，容易混淆。下表说明「同一个词，谁讲到什么程度」，帮你选对入口：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>本 hub（基础代数与函数）</th>\n<th>应去的兄弟 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实数与完备性</td>\n<td>直觉 + 浮点工程含义（<a href=\"algebra-basics/real-number-system\">实数系统</a>）</td>\n<td>公理化构造、确界、柯西列 → <a href=\"../real-analysis-measure/foundations/real-number-system-completeness\">19 实分析</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>作为映射的基本概念与图像</td>\n<td>集合论严格定义（单/满/双射）→ <a href=\"../discrete-mathematics/sets-and-logic/relations-functions\">07 离散数学</a>；连续/可导 → <a href=\"../calculus-applications/limits-continuity/limit-definition\">03 微积分</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方程组</td>\n<td>二元、手工消元</td>\n<td>多元、矩阵化、解的结构 → <a href=\"../linear-algebra/linear-equations/gaussian-elimination\">01 线性代数</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不等式</td>\n<td>一元解法与绝对值</td>\n<td>凸集、KKT、约束优化 → <a href=\"../optimization-theory/convex-optimization/convex-sets\">05 最优化</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数列与级数</td>\n<td>等差/等比、收敛初步、归纳法</td>\n<td>递推通解 → <a href=\"../discrete-mathematics/combinatorics/recurrence-relations\">07 离散数学</a>；ε-N 严格收敛 → <a href=\"../real-analysis-measure/foundations/sequences-limits-rigor\">19 实分析</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整数分解</td>\n<td>多项式因式分解</td>\n<td>素因子分解、模运算、密码学 → <a href=\"../number-theory/divisibility-primes/prime-numbers\">10 数论</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话边界：<strong>本 hub 讲「怎么算、为什么这样算」的运算直觉；兄弟 hub 讲「严格证明、高维推广、工程算法」。</strong> 遇到需要公理化或多维化的内容，请跳转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容地图\">内容地图</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第 1 章 代数基础</strong>——<a href=\"algebra-basics/real-number-system\">实数系统</a>、<a href=\"algebra-basics/algebraic-expressions\">代数表达式</a>、<a href=\"algebra-basics/polynomial-operations\">多项式运算</a>、<a href=\"algebra-basics/factoring-techniques\">因式分解技巧</a>。运算基本功，后续一切的前置。</li>\n<li><strong>第 2 章 函数与图像</strong>——<a href=\"functions-graphs/function-concept\">函数概念</a>、<a href=\"functions-graphs/linear-quadratic\">一次与二次函数</a>、<a href=\"functions-graphs/exponential-logarithmic\">指数与对数函数</a>、<a href=\"functions-graphs/function-transformations\">函数变换</a>。贯穿全书的核心抽象。</li>\n<li><strong>第 3 章 方程与不等式</strong>——<a href=\"equations-inequalities/linear-equations\">一次方程</a>、<a href=\"equations-inequalities/quadratic-equations\">二次方程</a>、<a href=\"equations-inequalities/inequality-solving\">不等式求解</a>、<a href=\"equations-inequalities/absolute-value\">绝对值与距离</a>。约束与求解的工具箱。</li>\n<li><strong>第 4 章 数列与级数</strong>——<a href=\"sequences-series/arithmetic-sequence\">等差数列</a>、<a href=\"sequences-series/geometric-sequence\">等比数列</a>、<a href=\"sequences-series/series-convergence\">级数与收敛性</a>、<a href=\"sequences-series/mathematical-induction\">数学归纳法</a>。递推、求和与证明思维。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>本 hub 是数学分区的最底层，<strong>几乎零数学前置</strong>——只需初中代数符号与基本运算习惯。代码示例用 TypeScript 表达，能读懂变量、循环、函数即可；不熟悉也不影响理解数学主线。本 hub 不要求微积分或线性代数基础（恰恰相反，它们以本 hub 为前置）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>数学基础生疏的程序员（主力读者）</strong>：按 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 顺序通读。第 1 章运算能力是一切的地基，第 2 章函数观念贯穿全书，务必扎实；第 3、4 章可按工作需求挑读。每篇结尾的「延伸阅读」给出跨 hub 跳板，看到感兴趣的高阶主题即可顺链深入。</li>\n<li><strong>只想补特定缺口（查漏型）</strong>：直接用上面的分工表定位入口。常见缺口：浮点为什么不精确 → <a href=\"algebra-basics/real-number-system\">实数系统</a>；对数/指数在 ML 里的角色 → <a href=\"functions-graphs/exponential-logarithmic\">指数与对数函数</a>；复杂度求和 → <a href=\"sequences-series/arithmetic-sequence\">等差</a>/<a href=\"sequences-series/geometric-sequence\">等比数列</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>准备进阶到高等数学（承上启下型）</strong>：重点打牢第 2 章函数与第 4 章级数/归纳法，再分别承接 <a href=\"../calculus-applications/limits-continuity/limit-definition\">03 微积分</a>（函数→极限）、<a href=\"../linear-algebra/linear-equations/gaussian-elimination\">01 线性代数</a>（方程组→矩阵）、<a href=\"../real-analysis-measure/foundations/real-number-system-completeness\">19 实分析</a>（实数→严格分析）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每篇都遵循「直觉理解 → 严格推导 → 编程印证」三段式，建议边读边动手敲代码，把抽象的代数性质落到可运行的实例上。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"algebra-basics","title":"代数基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/algebra-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"real-number-system","title":"实数系统与数的分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/algebra-basics/real-number-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"algebraic-expressions","title":"代数表达式与运算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/algebra-basics/algebraic-expressions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"polynomial-operations","title":"多项式运算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/algebra-basics/polynomial-operations"},{"seq":4,"slug":"factoring-techniques","title":"因式分解技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/algebra-basics/factoring-techniques"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"functions-graphs","title":"函数与图像","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/functions-graphs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"function-concept","title":"函数的概念与性质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/functions-graphs/function-concept"},{"seq":2,"slug":"linear-quadratic","title":"一次与二次函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/functions-graphs/linear-quadratic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"exponential-logarithmic","title":"指数与对数函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/functions-graphs/exponential-logarithmic"},{"seq":4,"slug":"function-transformations","title":"函数变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/functions-graphs/function-transformations"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"equations-inequalities","title":"方程与不等式","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/equations-inequalities","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"linear-equations","title":"一次方程与方程组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/equations-inequalities/linear-equations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quadratic-equations","title":"二次方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/equations-inequalities/quadratic-equations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inequality-solving","title":"不等式求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/equations-inequalities/inequality-solving"},{"seq":4,"slug":"absolute-value","title":"绝对值与距离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/equations-inequalities/absolute-value"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"sequences-series","title":"数列与级数","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/sequences-series","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"arithmetic-sequence","title":"等差数列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/sequences-series/arithmetic-sequence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"geometric-sequence","title":"等比数列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/sequences-series/geometric-sequence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"series-convergence","title":"级数与收敛性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/sequences-series/series-convergence"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mathematical-induction","title":"数学归纳法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/basic-algebra-functions/sequences-series/mathematical-induction"}]}]}